{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g4-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G4 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the UWELL Caliburn G4 Pod System, boasting a 1300mAh battery, adjustable 5–35W output, animated display, and versatile Storm and Wave Modes for an elevated vape experience. Cross-compatible with the Caliburn G3 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn GPP replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Caliburn g3 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis sleek device is crafted from durable aluminum-alloy and supports a resistance range of 0.4–0.9ohm, optimized for smooth flavor and cloud production. Its magnetic 3mL pod system uses Caliburn GPP Series pods and a convenient side-fill design, ensuring both ease of use and secure handling. With an adjustable airflow switch and intuitive draw-activation, users can fine-tune every puff. Whether in Storm Mode for powerful clouds or Wave Mode for consistent output, the G4 balances cutting-edge features with compact portability, making it a top-tier choice for everyday vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Caliburn\"\u003eCaliburn\u003c\/a\u003e G4 35W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 26mm x 15.65mm x 114.98mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1300mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 5-35W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRESISTANCE RANGE: 0.4-0.9ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDISPLAY SCREEN: Animated Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Adjustable Wattage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD SUPPORT: Caliburn GPP Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Adjustable Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStorm Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWave Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G4 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876307935287,"sku":"U Cali G4 Pod System","price":5100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g4_pod_system_-_glacier_blue.webp?v=1757901909","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g4-35w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




